# FlintTrade — data

> Local tick storage and processing, audit trails, order flow analysis, tax reports and Practice sandbox storage. Native tick capture is unavailable pending a native stream source.

## Key Modules

Modules below live in `src/flinttrade_data/`.

- `tick_recorder.py` — Local tick buffering/storage; native capture unavailable
- `audit_logger.py` — Configurable local audit trail retention
- `orderflow.py` / `orderflow_routes.py` — Order flow analysis and API routes
- `tax_report.py` / `tax_routes.py` — Tax report generation and API routes
- `storage.py` — DuckDB storage layer
- `sandbox_engine.py` / `sandbox_routes.py` — Internal Practice execution and API routes

Trade logging and P&L tracking live in `packages/services/journal/src/flinttrade_journal/` (`trade_logger.py`, `pnl_tracker.py`, `journal_routes.py`).

## Absorbs
- openquest → QuestDB tick aggregation, multi-exchange streaming, TradingView charts

## Dependencies

See `packages/core/data/pyproject.toml` for declared dependencies and optional extras.

## Tick source availability
- Existing local tick data can be queried and processed.
- No native streaming capture source is wired into this package.
- Enabling a capture environment flag does not provide a stream.
